    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i've definitely been going a bit too aggressive with the depth. i'll try taking smaller passes. do you think the moisture content of the walnut could be playing a part too? it's been pretty humid in the shop lately and i'm worried the wood might be too soft or just acting unpredictable.",
